pped with a wooden katana and feisty personality, Taiga is known throughout the school as the \\\"Palmtop Tiger.\\\"\\nOne day, an embarrassing mistake causes the two students to cross paths. Ryuuji discovers that Taiga actually has a sweet side: she has a crush on the popular vice president, Yuusaku Kitamura, who happens to be his best friend. But things only get crazier when Ryuuji reveals that he has a crush on Minori Kushieda—Taiga's best friend!Toradora! is a romantic comedy that follows this odd duo as they embark on a quest to help each other with their respective crushes, forming an unlikely alliance in the process.\\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"ya570uUgQNc\",\"name\":\"Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Ami Kawashima\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/25931/image/tiny-dc46bd7baaccaad39f373fe33c83c54f.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Eri Kitamura\"},{\"name\":\"Yuusaku Kitamura\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/25932/image/tiny-e78f976cbf992a57a703445c928e97fa.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Hirofumi Nojima\"},{\"name\":\"Minori Kushieda\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/25933/image/tiny-ebe88371c3fadce96383c7ece2960f4c.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Yui Horie\"},{\"name\":\"Ryuuji Takasu\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/25934/image/tiny-61e64440ce6214f38acdff52ff811b74.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Junji Majima\"},{\"name\":\"Stalker man\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/50052/image/tiny-25a1e017f57008c7bf8969bb04988d39.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Shinnosuke Tachibana\"},{\"name\":\"Yuu Aisaka\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/75842/image/tiny-f65b7a5f9a7d992d2fe20caee32e30f9.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Fuyuka Ono\"},{\"name\":\"Rikurou Aisaka\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/25937/image/tiny-ceffe811ddbaed026c